WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.160
Between 1954 to 1955, our beloved Istrouma High School had gotten beaten there by Baton Rouge High to go to the state championships.

2
00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:17.200
So we went out . . . Alvin did, he went out to the coaches,

3
00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:25.100
Coach Brown and them we knew real well, and offered that we would go set up a weight program for them.

4
00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:28.480
We set it up out there and then in the summertime, they all came to . . .

5
00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:28.680
To the gym?

6
00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:30.940
. . . to the gym.

7
00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.860
They brought them in a bus.

8
00:00:33.860 --> 00:00:41.180
And in that group was Billy Cannon, who became a Heisman award winner.

9
00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:46.380
And the LSU . . . Some of the other LSU players started coming when Billy went out there.

10
00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:54.600
And that was the time when Paul Dietzel was coach and Paul came to the gym and started getting his LSU players to come and . . .

11
00:00:54.600 --> 00:00:57.840
So LSU didn’t have its own weight room then, so . . . ?

12
00:00:57.840 --> 00:00:58.680
No. No, they didn’t.

13
00:00:58.680 --> 00:01:02.220
That was . . . Nobody in colleges were lifting weights then.

14
00:01:02.220 --> 00:01:04.560
Nobody in high school was lifting weights.

15
00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:08.960
Nobody in pro football or pro basketball was lifting weights.

16
00:01:08.960 --> 00:01:13.360
We started it all, right there, starting with the Istrouma High football team.

17
00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:17.980
They won eight out of eleven state championships in a row.

18
00:01:17.980 --> 00:01:20.000
I mean, they lost it a couple of times.

19
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:22.760
They lost in the finals one time.

20
00:01:22.760 --> 00:01:30.860
But it was just a dynasty that they built out there and it all started with the . . . So all the other kids started coming in there.

21
00:01:30.860 --> 00:01:34.860
There we had the summers were full and it just attracted other things.
